<view class="page">
  <view class="hero-card">
    <text class="eyebrow">绑定模块</text>
    <text class="page-title">子女绑定</text>
    <text class="page-desc">老人端生成 6 位绑定码，子女端输入后建立绑定关系。绑定成功后，子女端即可查看老人资料、订单和留言。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="code-card">
      <text class="muted">当前绑定码</text>
      <text class="bind-code">{{bindCode}}</text>
      <text class="helper-text">这是老人提供给子女的 6 位数字，演示时先在这里展示，再切到子女端输入。</text>
      <button class="btn-primary btn-block" style="margin-top: 20rpx;" bindtap="refreshCode">重新生成绑定码</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="section-head">
      <text class="section-title">确认绑定</text>
      <text class="section-link">{{bindStatusText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="card form-card">
      <view class="input-group" style="margin-top: 0;">
        <text class="input-label">绑定码</text>
        <input class="input" placeholder="请输入 6 位绑定码" maxlength="6" value="{{inputCode}}" bindinput="onInput" />
      </view>
      <button class="btn-accent btn-block" style="margin-top: 20rpx;" bindtap="confirmBind">确认绑定</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
